        "true": [
          {
            "id": "f4c36dda-b5bf-43aa-a26e-e074bf3346a1",
            "command": "EVENT_GROUP",
            "args": {},
            "children": {
              "true": [
                {
                  "id": "1a8b5d04-9eef-4456-a1fa-9d010878e87e",
                  "command": "EVENT_HIDE_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                },
                {
                  "id": "24197ce4-de1b-43bf-a654-3ae42aa1d1a5",
                  "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                  "args": {
                    "text": [
                      "Nib: The lodge\nboasts heated\nfloors, a private\nhorizon, and\nmature",
                      "silence. The\nsilence is\nactually a broken\npump. I wrote the\nlisting",
                      "before I saw the\npipe map. I would\nlike to correct\nthat before",
                      "someone believes\nme."
                    ],
                    "avatarId": "",
                    "minHeight": 4,
                    "maxHeight": 7,
                    "position": "bottom",
                    "closeWhen": "key",
                    "closeButton": "a"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "f110389d-5fd0-4bb7-a05c-6234ac48eb0b",
                  "command": "EVENT_SHOW_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f325c043-79af-4ce4-ae22-5cf698d6c626",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 1
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "f68bed54-e83d-4444-a419-08d3e9599650",
            "command": "EVENT_GROUP",
            "args": {},
            "children": {
              "true": [
                {
                  "id": "fc9bef8c-73ee-42a0-a294-f0ccecd48124",
                  "command": "EVENT_HIDE_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                },
                {
                  "id": "a3fdbdbb-a67d-449d-a690-22581eac9a29",
                  "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                  "args": {
                    "text": [
                      "Nib lays two pages\nside by side. The\ninvoice names one\nvalve",
                      "inspection and six\nrepaired roof\npanels. The sale\nschedule names the",
                      "lodge walls and\ncourtyard but\nexcludes municipal\npipes. A tempting",
                      "summary says Slush\npaid for\neverything below\nthe roof. Nib\ncrosses",
                      "it out. The\ninspection bill\nnames a service,\nnot a transfer of\nthe",
                      "inspected object.\nHe asks for\nwording a nervous\nbuyer could safely",
                      "repeat."
                    ],
                    "avatarId": "",
                    "minHeight": 4,
                    "maxHeight": 7,
                    "position": "bottom",
                    "closeWhen": "key",
                    "closeButton": "a"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "206bf34f-3cc9-4cc1-aeaf-3f0c3829d4bb",
                  "command": "EVENT_SHOW_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
