        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "c6640402-5f30-42ba-a968-072be840f76b",
            "command": "EVENT_GROUP",
            "args": {},
            "children": {
              "true": [
                {
                  "id": "8b35ff9d-357b-42e3-a21f-b1270b4b6954",
                  "command": "EVENT_HIDE_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                },
                {
                  "id": "f2661083-8f63-49d7-ab52-e9842c95c5ad",
                  "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                  "args": {
                    "text": [
                      "Which statement\ncan stay on the\ncorrected listing?\nConsider what the",
                      "invoice proves was\ndone and what the\nsale schedule\nactually",
                      "includes. Slush\nwill receive the\nrevision too. Nib\nwants to",
                      "acknowledge real\nrepairs without\nturning an\ninspected public\npipe",
                      "into private\nproperty, or\npretending a paid\ninspection was\nnever",
                      "useful work."
                    ],
                    "avatarId": "",
                    "minHeight": 4,
                    "maxHeight": 7,
                    "position": "bottom",
                    "closeWhen": "key",
                    "closeButton": "a"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "76451915-d79e-4c14-af25-defa9c8390d4",
                  "command": "EVENT_SHOW_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "68bd355c-69df-4223-aeaa-5f237643071d",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
